# Rocket-Powered Goblin Glider ({3} Equipment, Mayhem {2}): "When this Equipment enters, if it was cast from your graveyard, attach it to target creature you control. Equipped creature gets +2/+0
# and has flying and haste." On turn 3 Bot1 discards it to Faithless Looting (paid with Mox Ruby), and casts it from the graveyard for its mayhem cost, paid exactly with Mox Pearl and Mox Jet
# (the pool is empty). Its enters trigger asks for a target creature Bot1 controls: Bot2's Ornithopter is refused, Grizzly Bears chosen over Bot1's own Ornithopter. The Bears are then a 4/2
# with flying and haste.

